    "Coarelli, Rome and Environs (2007)"
   ],
   "note": "Line along the left bank following the excavated quay remains on Lungotevere Testaccio (OSM 'Emporium' site, bank bearing 46/226 deg), extended to ~410 m between the Lungotevere Testaccio/Aventino road line and the river (the NE end near the modern Ponte Sublicio, the SW end toward the Porticus Aemilia). rot faces the river (NW)."
